                        ['type' => 'mistake', 'sentence' => 'The report that the analyst wrote it, which was later revised, sparked controversy.', 'correction' => 'The report that the analyst wrote, which was later revised, sparked controversy.', 'note' => 'Ketika "that" berfungsi sebagai objek klausa relatif ("the analyst wrote"), tidak boleh ada kata ganti "it" yang menduplikasi fungsi objek tersebut di dalam klausa. Nomina yang dirujuk oleh "that" sudah cukup mewakili objek verba "wrote".'],
