                        ['type' => 'mistake', 'sentence' => 'Maybe it is that the intervention caused the improvement.', 'correction' => 'It is possible that the intervention caused the improvement.', 'note' => 'Struktur hedging akademik baku menempatkan adjektiva epistemik langsung setelah "it is/was", bukan menyisipkan kata keterangan seperti "maybe" di depan subjek dummy. Bentuk "Maybe it is that..." bukan struktur akademik standar dan terdengar canggung dalam register formal.'],
