                        ['type' => 'mistake', 'sentence' => 'If I was you, I would apologize to her.', 'correction' => 'If I were you, I would apologize to her.', 'note' => 'Dalam Second Conditional yang baku, gunakan "were" untuk semua subjek termasuk "I", bukan "was", terutama pada ungkapan tetap seperti "If I were you".'],
