                        ['type' => 'mistake', 'sentence' => 'If you practiced every day, you would can speak English fluently.', 'correction' => 'If you practiced every day, you could speak English fluently.', 'note' => 'Dua kata modal tidak bisa digabung langsung (would can). Untuk menunjukkan kemampuan hipotetis, cukup gunakan "could" saja tanpa "would".'],
