                [
                    'category' => 'Reported Speech',
                    'title' => 'Reported Statements: Backshifting Tenses',
                    'explanation' => 'Ketika mengubah kalimat langsung menjadi kalimat tidak langsung (reported speech) dan kata kerja pelapor (seperti said) berbentuk lampau, tense dalam kalimat yang dilaporkan biasanya bergeser mundur satu tingkat, proses ini disebut backshifting. Misalnya, Simple Present menjadi Simple Past, Present Continuous menjadi Past Continuous, Simple Past menjadi Past Perfect, dan Present Perfect menjadi Past Perfect. Aturan ini penting agar kalimat yang dilaporkan tetap logis dari sudut pandang waktu saat kalimat itu dilaporkan, bukan saat kalimat asli diucapkan.',
                    'formula' => 'Simple Present -> Simple Past | Present Continuous -> Past Continuous | Simple Past -> Past Perfect | Present Perfect -> Past Perfect',
                    'items' => [
                        ['type' => 'example', 'sentence' => 'Direct: "I am tired." -> Reported: She said (that) she was tired.', 'translation' => 'Langsung: "Saya lelah." -> Tidak langsung: Dia bilang dia lelah.'],
                        ['type' => 'example', 'sentence' => 'Direct: "I work in Jakarta." -> Reported: He said (that) he worked in Jakarta.', 'translation' => 'Langsung: "Saya bekerja di Jakarta." -> Tidak langsung: Dia bilang dia bekerja di Jakarta.'],
                        ['type' => 'example', 'sentence' => 'Direct: "I have finished the report." -> Reported: She said (that) she had finished the report.', 'translation' => 'Langsung: "Saya sudah menyelesaikan laporan." -> Tidak langsung: Dia bilang dia sudah menyelesaikan laporan.'],
                        ['type' => 'example', 'sentence' => 'Direct: "I am watching a movie." -> Reported: He said (that) he was watching a movie.', 'translation' => 'Langsung: "Saya sedang menonton film." -> Tidak langsung: Dia bilang dia sedang menonton film.'],
                        ['type' => 'mistake', 'sentence' => 'She said that she is tired.', 'correction' => 'She said that she was tired.', 'note' => 'Karena kata kerja pelapor "said" berbentuk lampau, tense dalam kalimat yang dilaporkan harus bergeser mundur (backshift) dari Simple Present (is) menjadi Simple Past (was).'],
