                        ['type' => 'example', 'sentence' => 'If I weren\'t afraid of heights, I would have joined the skydiving trip last weekend.', 'translation' => 'Seandainya saya tidak takut ketinggian (sifat umum), saya pasti sudah ikut terjun payung akhir pekan lalu.'],
